{
    "title": "Advance Auto Parts",
    "description": "Shopping for auto parts has never been easier with the Advance Auto Parts mobile app. Quickly find the right part for your vehicle, check part availability at over 5,000 Advance and Carquest stores, and easily order parts for pickup or delivery. Choose from hundreds of popular brands, including our own DieHard, Carquest and AutoCraft.\r\n\r\n- Choose SAME DAY HOME DELIVERY to get your order fast.\r\n- Order by 4 PM, delivery by 8 PM.\r\n\r\nSHOP FASTER AND SMARTER\r\n- Save vehicles to easily find parts that fit.\r\n- Check availability for pickup or delivery.\r\n- See product ratings, warranties, and descriptions to help you choose the right product.\r\n- Pay your way with credit cards, PayPal, Google Pay, and Advance Auto Parts Gift Cards.\r\n- Securely save credit/debit cards to your account for faster checkout.\r\n- Scan a product bar code to easily see product details, reviews, and order.\r\n- See our product recommendations and make sure you have what you need to complete your project.\r\n- Get everything you need for your projects at a great price with our bundles and project builders.\r\n- Order with ease!\r\n\r\nMANAGE YOUR SPEED PERKS REWARDS Get points on every purchase.\r\n- Check your member status.\r\n- View and redeem rewards.\r\n- Earn $5 Perk Bucks & $0.05/gal Gas Rewards every 500 points.\r\n- Enter receipts to get credit for store or guest purchases.\r\n- Not a member? Sign up today with ease and save more with hassle-free, easy-to-redeem rewards!\r\n\r\nVIEW YOUR ORDERS\r\n- Sign in to view your online order history.\r\n- View your current order status on the Home screen.\r\n\r\nFIND A STORE NEAR YOU\r\n- Choose from over 5,000 Advance and Carquest Auto Parts stores.\r\n- Check store hours, call ahead, and get directions. Save your preferred store for free, in store pickup.\r\n- Plus, stop in and receive personalized care with services such as check engine light scanning, wiper blade installation, and battery testing and installation, and more.\r\n\r\nEASILY ADD & SAVE YOUR VEHICLES\r\n- Choose the option that works best for you:\r\n- Scan your VIN code or VIN number\r\n- Enter your VIN number\r\n- Enter your license plate number\r\n- Select your year, make, model, and engine\r\n\r\nCONTACT US FOR CUSTOMER SUPPORT\r\n- Contact Customer Care to get help with your order.\r\n- Download now and start shopping for the parts you need.\r\n\r\nYou can tell us about your experience, ask questions, give feedback and make feature requests by contacting us at customerservice@advanceautoparts.com.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Shopping for auto parts has never been easier with the Advance Auto Parts mobile app. Quickly find the right part for your vehicle, check part availability at over 5,000 Advance and Carquest stores, and easily order parts for pickup or delivery. Choose from hundreds of popular brands, including our own DieHard, Carquest and AutoCraft.<br><br>- Choose SAME DAY HOME DELIVERY to get your order fast.<br>- Order by 4 PM, delivery by 8 PM.<br><br>SHOP FASTER AND SMARTER<br>- Save vehicles to easily find parts that fit.<br>- Check availability for pickup or delivery.<br>- See product ratings, warranties, and descriptions to help you choose the right product.<br>- Pay your way with credit cards, PayPal, Google Pay, and Advance Auto Parts Gift Cards.<br>- Securely save credit/debit cards to your account for faster checkout.<br>- Scan a product bar code to easily see product details, reviews, and order.<br>- See our product recommendations and make sure you have what you need to complete your project.<br>- Get everything you need for your projects at a great price with our bundles and project builders.<br>- Order with ease!<br><br>MANAGE YOUR SPEED PERKS REWARDS Get points on every purchase.<br>- Check your member status.<br>- View and redeem rewards.<br>- Earn $5 Perk Bucks &amp; $0.05/gal Gas Rewards every 500 points.<br>- Enter receipts to get credit for store or guest purchases.<br>- Not a member? Sign up today with ease and save more with hassle-free, easy-to-redeem rewards!<br><br>VIEW YOUR ORDERS<br>- Sign in to view your online order history.<br>- View your current order status on the Home screen.<br><br>FIND A STORE NEAR YOU<br>- Choose from over 5,000 Advance and Carquest Auto Parts stores.<br>- Check store hours, call ahead, and get directions. Save your preferred store for free, in store pickup.<br>- Plus, stop in and receive personalized care with services such as check engine light scanning, wiper blade installation, and battery testing and installation, and more.<br><br>EASILY ADD &amp; SAVE YOUR VEHICLES<br>- Choose the option that works best for you:<br>- Scan your VIN code or VIN number<br>- Enter your VIN number<br>- Enter your license plate number<br>- Select your year, make, model, and engine<br><br>CONTACT US FOR CUSTOMER SUPPORT<br>- Contact Customer Care to get help with your order.<br>- Download now and start shopping for the parts you need.<br><br>You can tell us about your experience, ask questions, give feedback and make feature requests by contacting us at customerservice@advanceautoparts.com.",
